          </p>

          <p>
            The fair conclusion is that you are paying for convenience and taste, not cheap protein. Premier Protein Cereal is the one ready-made option that competes on cost with powder. Magic Spoon competes on taste and its keto profile, and many buyers think that is worth the premium. If price per gram is the priority, though, the DIY bowl in the next section wins easily.
